party normie loyalties.

00:15:42.279 --> 00:15:45.600
MSNBC and CNN actually did have some power.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:48.470
Regardless of all the calls that they're dying,
they're dead.

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:49.470
They're irrelevant.

